id=mu300_linux_switch
name=MU300 Linux switch
version=v1.0
versionCode=1
author=dikeckaan
description=Boot the Linux system on slot b from Android. Arms the one-shot trial in misc (32 bytes) and reboots. Writes nothing else - boot_a, the GPT and userdata are never touched, and a Linux that fails to boot falls back to Android by itself.
